# Build output (always rebuildable from source)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Deployed/runtime instance: databases, logs, secrets, generated license files.
# This is NOT source code and must never be committed.
/App/

# Standalone vendor tool: NEVER commit. Its source embeds the RSA PRIVATE signing
# key. If this ever reaches a public or compromised account, every license this
# software has issued becomes forgeable. Keep it local-only / offline-backed.
/Keygen/
/Source/Tools/Keygen/

# Local file backups made during development sessions.
/Backups/

# Misc local artifacts
*.log
*.bak
page-timing.log
